  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. To a medium heatproof bowl, add couscous and the salt.\n• Add the boiling water (3/4 cup for 2 people / 11/2 cups for 4 people) and stir to combine. Immediately cover with a plate and leave for 5 minutes.\n• Fluff up with a fork and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83f77cade9b9f0acdf244/step-ef42aa00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic.\n• Drain and rinse chickpeas.\n• Halve snacking tomatoes.\n• Thinly slice cucumber into rounds.\n• Slice lemon into wedges.\n• In a small bowl, combine hummus, harissa paste and a splash of water. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83f77cade9b9f0acdf244/step-601af410.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook chickpeas, stirring, until slightly tender, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add the butter, paprika spice blend and garlic, then cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• In a large bowl, combine a good squeeze of lemon juice, a good drizzle of olive oil and a pinch of salt and pepper.\n• To the dressing, add cooked couscous, cucumber, tomatoes and rocket leaves. Toss to combine and season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83f77cade9b9f0acdf244/step-e64b0020.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide couscous salad between bowls, then top with paprika spiced chickpeas.\n• Dollop over harissa hummus and garnish with pepitas.\n• Serve with remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83f77cade9b9f0acdf244/step-254aa030.jpg"
    }
  ]
